{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026uWwwuLgp4a1793022659.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外交部回應美國國防部將孔子學院列為國家安全威脅，表示反對抹黑和污名化，強調中美教育交流合作互利共贏，不應受干擾破壞。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆表示：「我們反對針對孔子學院的抹黑和污名化，中美教育交流合作有利於增進兩國人民相互了解，是雙向的、互利共贏的，不應該受到干擾和破壞。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:09.050350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:18:13.098114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:15.850049+00:00","content_hash":"bd750f422061ab905ff26d78343f8f2746d27e369fc20f5405bc00b155089122","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:09.050350+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}